claim.claim-text:
a housing (110) having at least a portion sized and shaped to be handheld by a user, wherein said housing (110) comprises an electrically conductive portion (1815) configured to be grasped by said user during operation and electrically connected to a direct current battery (1010);
a reservoir (125) configured to contain a fluid;
at least one nozzle (1015) in fluid communication with said reservoir (125), wherein the direct current battery (1010) is configured to power delivery of the fluid from the reservoir to the at least one nozzle; and
an electrode assembly (1310) configured to electrostatically charge the fluid, wherein a plurality of electrodes of the electrode assembly is configured to emit ions parallel to a flow pathway of the fluid emitted from the at least one nozzle such that the plurality of electrodes form a static electrical field through which the fluid passes.
